    "body": "## Summary\n- Add a persistent mobile top bar and shared chat with a resizable divider.\n- Add three accessible tabs for existing DM, battle, and event panels. Keep entity state and panel scroll, and source badges from existing counters.\n- Support horizontal swipe only in the lower panel, touch long-press stat hints, visualViewport keyboard sizing, and safe-area insets.\n- Fix the mobile Goal body flex-shrink collapse without changing Goal copy or bypassing onboarding locks.\n- Mirror Web and docs files and add a Codex Browser regression runner.\n\n## Evidence\n- Codex in-app Browser exact-size fixtures: 320x568 (22/22), 360x640 (22/22), 390x844 (31/31), 430x932 (22/22), 768x1024 (22/22), 1280x720 (7/7), 1440x900 (7/7): 133/133.\n- 390x844 same-condition Goal-copy comparison reproduces 0px with both main and PR #427 copy when flex shrink is reintroduced; normal production style displays the open Goal body. Closed and onboarding-locked states remain distinct.\n- `node --check` on both UI-core mirrors, `git diff --check`, Web/docs parity, repository policy validator, and 17 policy unit tests pass.\n- The real operating-system keyboard and Safari have not been tested. User Safari acceptance remains required.\n\n## Scope\n- PR #427 and its branch were not modified; no Goal copy was edited here.\n- No game rules, NPCs, economy, reputation, scenario state, event system, rewards, or saves were intentionally changed.\n- Draft for ChatGPT review. Do not merge before review and user Safari acceptance.",
